==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

How to connect to the Serial Port of this specific device:

| {{media:doc:hardware:serial:usb_to_rs232.ttl.jpeg?100|}} | Use a [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial#usb.to.rs232.ttl.converter.module|serial TTL]] adapter to connect your PC with the router. Only connect TX, RX and GND. |
  **Settings:**\\
  * Baudrate: 115200
  * Data bits: 8
  * Parity: None
  * Stop bits: 1


The serial port is located at the Jumper J302 on the board:

<a2s>
  1   2   3   4
#----------------#
|.-. .-. .-. .-. |
|'-' '-' '-' '-' |
#----------------#  J302
 GND TX  VCC  RX
</a2s>

Only connect GND, TX and RX. (Never connect VCC, you may damage the board otherwise)



